									"height": 110,
									"text": "MWT-UC2 Log In: Customer and Employee authenticate using a registered account.\nAuthentication failure returns to credentials input; another LogIn() request starts a retry.\nAfter successful Customer login, MWT-UC3 starts automatically at step (2).\nEmployee login has no history popup. History query errors preserve successful authentication."
