											"showShadow": false,
											"left": 15,
											"top": 1830,
											"width": 1750,
											"height": 115,
											"text": "Authentication failure: missing accounts or incorrect passwords return a failure result; the user may correct credentials and submit again.\nLookup errors: return an error result and stop authentication before Member calls; do not treat errors as absent accounts or open a session/home.\nCustomer history: customer login starts UC3. Employee login has no history popup; history errors and popup closure preserve authentication."
										},
