									"name": "ViewPreviousTravelHistory()",
									"documentation": "Analysis trace: MWT-UC2 main step (4), continuing to MWT-UC3 step (2) for Customer only.\nStarts MWT-UC3 at history lookup after successful customer authentication. Detailed history retrieval is defined in MWT-UC3.",
