									"documentation": "Analysis trace: MWT-UC2 main step (4).\nCompletion of the preceding void UI operation; returned to MemberView, which made the call. The displayed UI outcome is documented in a note, rather than modeled as a method return to the actor.",
									"source": {
										"$ref": "MWT_UC2_5b619e82db7d466d8fc65581989941bb"
