									},
									"name": "loginResult",
									"documentation": "Display the existing LoginResult after the selected authentication branch. Failure allows corrected credentials and a new submission or cancellation. History errors preserve authentication. Resubmission is described in the short prose rather than a loop.",
									"source": {
