	"documentation": "Editable StarUML project containing UC2 Log In, its conditional UC3 extension and one sequence diagram. One authentication alt, an optional password check and optional customer history show the main collaboration. Brief English prose describes authentication failure, lookup errors and history handling. Existing class definitions and signatures are preserved.",
	"documentVersion": 1
}